# PMD repo-root self-scan marker for whole-repo scans of THIS repo.
#
# Purpose: the Stage 5 seed fixture under tests/fixtures/secure-scan-demo/
# carries a deliberately vulnerable Java file (app/App.java, EmptyCatchBlock).
# Any future whole-repo self-scan of this config repo must not re-report it as
# a fresh finding. The wrapper (scripts/pmd-scanner-wrapper.sh) injects
# `--exclude-pattern 'tests/fixtures/'` when this marker exists at the scan root;
# ordinary pipeline targets do not have it, so they stay byte-for-byte
# unaffected, and the e2e gate mounts the fixture itself — where no marker
# exists — so the fixture oracle still fires. See README "Security operation
# notes".
